- A1 §2 typography precedent: NOT APPLICABLE — no typography/particle text; the build carries no subject text at all.
- A5 Owner Cures 1–2: NOT APPLICABLE as particle/phrase cures — no particle field, no phrase lifecycle. The analogous separation here is identity-level: shell (dark, segmented) vs flesh (bright, smooth) are different kinds of mark by construction, never the same mark at two intensities.
- A5 §4 flow-field model: NOT APPLICABLE — no particle pool.
- A9.1 plate construction: the board is a STILL plate (flat ground + plank lines, no motion) — any background motion would exceed the technique; priced here so Plan-exit need not ask.
